# Managed by Ansible (roles/caddy). The edge is reachable from the internet.
# The play asserts the effective values with `sshd -T`, so a missing Include in
# sshd_config fails the play instead of leaving password auth silently on.
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitRootLogin no
MaxAuthTries 3
X11Forwarding no
